// The contour closed: back onto the point it started from, as a curve if a
// control point is still waiting and as a straight line if not.
//
// It sits with the segment emitters rather than with the walk that calls it
// because the walk's file already holds three functions -- which is the
// three-per-file rule putting a function one directory away from the only
// thing that calls it.
ras_close(int[] buf) {
  if(buf[6] == 1) {
    ras_quad(buf, buf[7], buf[8]);
  } else {
    ras_line(buf, buf[7], buf[8]);
  }
} return void;
